ood question jillian it's  affordable luxury because i myself um  growing up the way i did i'm always  looking for a bargain i mean lomans if  anybody from the east coast remembers  you know was the bargain place where you  get designer clothes for less which now  became so many other stores i think it  was embedded in me to um find the best  of everything at a good value and you  don't have to overpay for furniture and  you don't have to overpay for rugs and  what's great about jill's aaron rugs is  that they're pet proof or stain proof if  you want to call it um everything comes  out of that pretty much so i think  that's why it's gained so much momentum  over the years because people tell  people that they have these outdoor rugs  indoor rugs that don't stain so and  they're very affordable they start at 49  and go up to about 500 for the biggest  ones so you can imagine what value that  is well jill you're speaking my language  i love a good bargain thank you so much  for sharing everything with us and real  quick i know you run a lot of businesses  but people can find you and all of your  items on social media and your website  right  absolutely jilzarin.com and jill and  ali.com before you leave i just want to  show you we have these manifestation  candles with crystals so for this time  of year if you have things that you hope  and dream for or just want to make  better about yourself this one is less  is more which we can all do decluttering  these inspiration candles have been  doing phenomenal on jillianally.com i  love that i'm gonna have to get me one  of those jill thank you so much hope to  see you in vegas next time jc i'll send  it over to you thank
 

